@host = http://localhost:5100

### Service description and endpoint list
GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Health probe
GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Happy path: publish one order and watch the full chain in the consumer logs
# orders -> shipments -> deliveries, plus a notification at each stage.
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "customerName": "Alice Johnson",
  "currency": "USD",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "PROD-101", "productName": "Wireless Headphones", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 199.99 },
    { "productId": "PROD-205", "productName": "USB-C Cable (3-pack)", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 25.00 }
  ]
}

### Transient failure: fails twice, then the retry succeeds on attempt 3
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-FLAKY",
  "customerName": "Retry Demo",
  "currency": "USD",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "PROD-312", "productName": "Mechanical Keyboard", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 59.95 }
  ]
}

### Permanent failure: exhausts all retries, logs PROCESSING ABANDONED, skips the message
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-FAIL",
  "customerName": "Abandon Demo",
  "currency": "USD",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "PROD-666", "productName": "Cursed Widget", "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 13.13 }
  ]
}

### Validation failure: empty item list is rejected with 400 before anything is published
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-002",
  "customerName": "Bob Martinez",
  "currency": "USD",
  "items": []
}

### Bulk publish: builds lag and spreads keys across all 3 partitions
POST {{host}}/api/orders/bulk?count=30

### Committed offsets, high watermarks and lag per partition (written to the API logs)
GET {{host}}/api/kafka/offsets
Accept: application/json
